# Server

- Socket handlers coordinate; they do not calculate damage, rewards, or permissions.
- Authenticate from server session context. Ignore client-supplied account, role, or character authority.
- Validate every command and socket payload at the boundary.
- Persist critical mutations before acknowledging success.
- Duplicate command IDs must not duplicate movement, items, or rewards.
- Enforce classroom mode defaults: no public registration, DMs, or PvP.
